@baseUrl = http://localhost:5182
@gatewayJwt = replace-with-a-short-lived-gateway-token
@importId = replace-with-the-returned-import-id
@documentId = replace-with-the-returned-document-id
@revision = replace-with-the-returned-revision

### Production calls require a valid gateway JWT; never save real tokens here.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Upload private source files. Replace paths and use a matching sitting.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=import-boundary

--import-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"

{"subjectId":"biology","level":"havo","year":2025,"timevak":1,"chapterNumber":"2","chapterTitle":"Cellen","topics":[{"id":"biology-cells","title":"Cellen","description":"Celstructuur en de functie van celonderdelen","keywords":["cel"],"exclusions":[],"aliases":[],"chapterNumber":"2","paragraphNumber":"2.1"}]}
--import-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="exam"; filename="exam.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\private\exam.pdf
--import-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="answers"; filename="answers.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\private\answers.pdf
--import-boundary--

### Durable progress list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Review detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Confirm screenshot-derived definitions (only awaitingDefinitions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}/confirm-definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":"{{revision}}","topics":[{"id":"biology-cells","title":"Cellen","description":"Celstructuur en de functie van celonderdelen","keywords":["cel"],"exclusions":[],"aliases":[],"chapterNumber":"2","paragraphNumber":"2.1"}]}

### Save the COMPLETE returned topic/question arrays, with checked page links
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":"{{revision}}","topics":[],"questions":[]}

### Publish only a saved, fully checked draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":"{{revision}}"}

### Cancellation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":"{{revision}}"}

### Explicit, cost-aware retry of a failed import
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":"{{revision}}"}

### Protected partial PDF delivery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
Range: bytes=0-1023

### Published trainer catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog?subjectId=biology
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Subject/sitting lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exams?subjectId=biology&level=havo&year=2025&timevak=1
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Independent topic search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics?subjectId=biology&search=cel
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Questions across exams/chapters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions?subjectId=biology&topicId=biology-cells
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Verified pair metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exams/{{importId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}

### Unknown ID returns 404, not a storage/provider error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayJwt}}
